---
const areas = ['South Bend', 'Mishawaka', 'Elkhart', 'Granger', 'Goshen', 'Niles, MI'];
---

<section id="about" class="border-t border-line py-24 sm:py-32">
	<div class="container-x grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-20">
		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[360px] lg:mx-0">
			<img
				src="/assets/photo.webp"
				alt="Joe Hollenbach, founder of Michiana Dev LLC"
				width="640"
				height="640"
				loading="lazy"
				class="aspect-square w-full rounded-2xl border border-line object-cover grayscale-[25%]"
			/>
			<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">
				<span class="font-semibold text-ink">Joe Hollenbach</span> — Founder & software engineer
			</p>
		</div>

		<div>
			<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
			<h2 class="display mt-5 text-[clamp(2.4rem,5.4vw,4.2rem)]">A studio of one, <span class="serif-accent text-gradient">by design.</span></h2>
			<div class="mt-7 space-y-5 text-[1.08rem] leading-relaxed text-body">
				<p>
					I’m Joe Hollenbach, founder of Michiana Dev LLC, an Indiana company based in Mishawaka. I have a B.S. in Software Engineering, and I build websites the same way I build software: carefully, from scratch, and with a clear purpose. Every project gets senior-level design and engineering, because I’m the one doing both.
				</p>
				<p>
					I build for businesses that want their website or software to be a real advantage, whether that’s a professional firm, a local service company, or a founder launching a new product. I’ve also built and run my own SaaS, RankRadius, so I understand products from both sides: the code and the customer.
				</p>
				<p>
					When you work with me, you talk directly to the person designing and writing your site. No account managers, no outsourcing, no surprises.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-10 border-t border-line pt-8">
				<p class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Serving Michiana and clients nationwide</p>
				<ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
					{areas.map((a) => <li class="rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-ink">{a}</li>)}
					<li class="rounded-full bg-ink px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-paper">Nationwide (remote)</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
